---
title: Filspresso Next - Coffee Stock Read Path Sequence
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Next.js (BFF)
    participant NEST as NestJS Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    B->>N: Open /coffee page
    Note over N: proxy.ts rewrites /coffee → /?page=coffee
    N->>N: Load page component dynamically
    N->>NEST: GET /api/products/coffee
    NEST->>DB: SELECT coffee_products<br/>product_id, name, stock, price, category, intensity
    NEST->>DB: SELECT cart_items<br/>WHERE product_type = 'capsule'<br/>(active reservations)
    DB-->>NEST: Product rows + active cart reservations
    NEST->>NEST: Compute available_stock = stock - reserved
    NEST-->>N: Product payload with available_stock
    N-->>B: Render coffee cards with stock badges

    Note over NEST,DB: Indexes on product_id, product_type, category
    Note over NEST,DB: Single read per page load — no polling needed
    Note over B,N: Cart polling (45s interval) runs separately via useCart hook
